title: Gatekeeper
---
<<if coins() >= 5>>
    Gatekeeper: Five coins! A deal's a deal.
    <<take_coins 5>>
    <<open_gate>>
    Gatekeeper: The flag is past the gate. Go win.
<<else>>
    Gatekeeper: Nobody gets through this gate for less than 5 coins.
    Gatekeeper: You've got {coins()}.
    -> Where are the coins?
        Gatekeeper: Up on the platforms. Watch out for the slimes.
    -> Can I just have some?
        Gatekeeper: Fine. One. Don't tell anyone.
        <<give_coins 1>>
    -> Okay, bye.
<<endif>>
===
